fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
# /effort while the catalog is still on its way (each read answers 4 s after
# it is asked): the loading notice (`handleEffort`,
# `session_commands.zig:1004-1006@481104fd`), then the menu once the
# launch's read has landed. `modelsdelay` stamps the gateway log's catalog
# lines with when they were asked and answered.
models p5-effort-fork-models.json
modelsdelay 4000
seed p5-effort-fork-seed-astra.json
nomodel
wait 1
type /effort
key Enter
wait 0.5
snap early
wait 5
type /effort
key Enter
wait 1
snap later
gwlog
